  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "FIRST TO 7 \u2022 1v1 \u2022 Your truck IS the mallet.\n\nDrive forward,
    steer and brake/reverse relative to your truck. Strike the puck physically; no
    shoot button. Trucks stay in their own half and outside goals. The puck crosses
    center freely and rebounds from rails. No possession or aiming assist.\n\nWhole
    puck crossing inside the opening scores for the opponent of that goal, including
    own goals. The conceding player serves after a brief countdown. Opening serve
    alternates on rematches. Escaped or genuinely trapped pucks recover fairly without
    changing scores; a reachable stationary puck stays in play.\n\nKeyboard: Blue
    W/A/S/D; Orange arrows. Whole controller: left stick steer, RT forward, LT brake/reverse.
    Shared controller: each stick X steers / Y drives its own truck. North joins,
    Start/Escape pauses. Each input source has one owner. Reconnect/reassign and
    release controls before confirming. Mouse / arrows / D-pad / Enter / South navigate
    menus."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
